ource\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a> to an enemy to regain a <a href=\"/wiki/Portent\" title=\"Portent\">Portent Die</a>. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_RemoveOnRespec\" title=\"SG RemoveOnRespec\">SG_RemoveOnRespec</a></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is one of the randomly selected prophecies to fulfill from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Expert_Divination\" title=\"Expert Divination\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp/25px-Expert_Divination_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp/38px-Expert_Divination_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp/50px-Expert_Divination_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Expert Divination\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp/25px-Expert_Divination_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Expert_Divination\" title=\"Expert Divination\">Expert Divination</a>.</li>\n<li>Damage from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloud_of_Daggers\" title=\"Cloud of Daggers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp/25px-Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp/38px-Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp/50px-Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloud of Daggers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp/25px-Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cloud_of_Daggers\" title=\"Cloud of Daggers\">Cloud of Daggers</a> will not fulfill this prophecy, as Cloud of Daggers is a \"summon\" and thus the source of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a> damage, not the caster.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Prophecy:_Cutting_Edge\">Sources of Prophecy: Cutting Edge</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Expert_Divination\" title=\"Expert Divination\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp/30px-Expert_Divination_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp/45px-Expert_Divination_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp/60px-Expert_Divination_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Expert Divination\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp/30px-Expert_Divination_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Expert_Divination\" title=\"Expert Divination\">Expert Divination</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202540\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2114/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21433/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9187/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1037815/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTra